    "excerpt": "Thailand's best EV-friendly hotels ranked by charging speed, reliability, and family-friendliness. From Bangkok luxury to Phuket beachfront and Chiang Mai mountain retreats — find your perfect EV-ready stay.",
    "date": "2026-05-17",
