    "title": "Top 10 EV-Friendly Destinations in Thailand for Families 2026",
    "excerpt": "Thailand's EV charging network is booming. We rank the top 10 destinations for family EV road trips — from Bangkok's chargers to Phuket's beach resorts and Chiang Mai's mountain routes.",
    "date": "2026-05-16",
