    "excerpt": "Can you drive an EV from Phnom Penh to Siem Reap to see Angkor Wat? Yes — with 200+ charging stations nationwide and the new expressway charging corridor, Cambodia's iconic road trip is now EV-friendly. Complete route guide, charging stops, and costs.",
