    "excerpt": "More Asian airports are adding EV charging for travelers. From Singapore Changi to Tokyo Narita, here are the top 10 airports with the best EV charging facilities, parking rates, charger types, and tips for EV owners leaving their car at the airport.",
    "date": "2026-05-14",
